    "title": "Resident Evil 2 - 1-Shot Demo",
    "videoId": "Dhj_CqbMQ9U",
    "externalUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dhj_CqbMQ9U",
    "channelTitle": "Resident Evil",
    "channelId": "UCS2iGSouOopNHXFBcWtBQiA",
    "description": "Thirty minutes, one shot! The Resident Evil 2 “1-Shot” Demo is coming to PS4, Xbox One, and Steam on January 11th! \n\nFor more official news and updates, follow us on:\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/RE_Games\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/residentevil/\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/re_games/ \nwww.residentevil2.com"
   },
   {
    "isOpenCritic": false,
    "isSpecial": "NO",
    "_id": "61aa99a5063ab93b368054fb",
    "publishedDate": "2018-12-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Resident Evil 2: Claire Gameplay - Unstoppable Tyrant",
    "videoId": "rMo8LNXN_ss",
    "externalUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rMo8LNXN_ss",
    "channelTitle": "Resident Evil",
    "channelId": "UCS2iGSouOopNHXFBcWtBQiA",
    "description": "His boots were made for stomping. See what it's like to take on the Tyrant in this new gameplay video featuring Claire in Resident Evil 2! Can Claire put a halt to the unstoppable force? Plus, get a quick look at Sherry Birkin and the new Orphanage area.\n\n'Like' on Facebook\nhttp://www.facebook.com/residentevil\n\nFollow on Twitter\nhttp://twitter.com/#!/RE_games"
   },
   {
    "isOpenCritic": false,
    "isSpecial": "NO",
