    "publishedDate": "2018-12-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Resident Evil 2: Leon Gameplay - Familiar Faces",
    "videoId": "T78HIXVAkTo",
    "externalUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T78HIXVAkTo",
    "channelTitle": "Resident Evil",
    "channelId": "UCS2iGSouOopNHXFBcWtBQiA",
    "description": "Get a closer look at some of the familiar faces you'll see and sinister places you'll go as Leon attempts to survive the nightmare of Raccoon City, including gameplay featuring Ada Wong.\n\n 'Like' on Facebook\nhttp://www.facebook.com/residentevil\n\nFollow on Twitter\nhttp://twitter.com/#!/RE_games"
   },
   {
    "isOpenCritic": false,
