    "_id": "61aa99a5063ab93b368054fa",
    "publishedDate": "2018-10-31T00:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Resident Evil 2 - Classic Costumes",
    "videoId": "30BQjlXXamY",
    "externalUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=30BQjlXXamY",
    "channelTitle": "Resident Evil",
    "channelId": "UCS2iGSouOopNHXFBcWtBQiA",
    "description": "We have a treat for you! As a thanks for your undying support, we’re providing all Resident Evil 2 players with a piece of nostalgia: Leon and Claire’s classic costumes will be unlockable in-game, for free!\n#RE2\n\nFor more official news and updates, follow us on:\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/RE_Games\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/residentevil/\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/re_games/ \nwww.residentevil2.com"
   },
   {
