    "videoId": "KyGk4KTJu5w",
    "externalUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KyGk4KTJu5w",
    "channelTitle": "Resident Evil",
    "channelId": "UCS2iGSouOopNHXFBcWtBQiA",
    "description": "Check out our latest trailer that delves into the story of RE2...\n\nFor more official news and updates, follow us on: \nTwitter - https://twitter.com/RE_Games \nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/residentevil/ \nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/re_games/\nwww.residentevil.com"
   },
   {
