    "publishedDate": "2018-06-20T00:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Resident Evil 2 - E3 2018 Gameplay Video",
    "videoId": "ahu9VmQ6RcY",
    "externalUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ahu9VmQ6RcY",
    "channelTitle": "Resident Evil",
    "channelId": "UCS2iGSouOopNHXFBcWtBQiA",
    "description": "In 4K where available! Itching for more Resident Evil 2 gameplay? We’ve got fresh video for you to sink your teeth into. Pre-order now, and play Resident Evil 2 as soon as it's available on January 25th, 2019.\n\n'Like' on Facebook\nhttp://www.facebook.com/residentevil\n\nFollow on Twitter\nhttp://twitter.com/#!/RE_games"
   },
   {
    "isOpenCritic": false,
    "isSpecial": "NO",
    "_id": "61aa99a5063ab93b368054f7",
    "publishedDate": "2018-06-19T00:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Resident Evil 2 - E3 2018 Developer Interview & Community Reaction",
    "videoId": "MNvDtoFimTw",
    "externalUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MNvDtoFimTw",
    "channelTitle": "Resident Evil",
    "channelId": "UCS2iGSouOopNHXFBcWtBQiA",
    "description": "Resident Evil 2 Remake was finally revealed at E3 2018! Our community manager Kat got to interview developers Yoshiaki 'H' Hirabayashi, and Tsuyoshi Kanda, as well as ask some fans what they thought of the E3 demo! \n\nResident Evil 2 returns this January 25th 2019, for PS4, Xbox One and PC! \n------\nFor more official news and updates, follow us on:\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/RE_Games\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/residentevil/\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/re_games/ \nAnd of course, subscribe to our Youtube channel!"
   },
